        "name": "biomodels-rdf",
        "metadata_modified": "2016-07-30T07:32:20.371686",
        "author": "",
        "url": null,
        "notes": "BioModels Database is a reliable repository of computational models of biological processes. It hosts models described in peer-reviewed scientific literature and models generated automatically from pathway resources (Path2Models). A large number of models collected from literature are manually curated and semantically enriched with cross-references from external data resources.\r\n\r\nBioModels Linked Dataset captures the content of the models in BioModels Database (primarilly encoded in the SBML format) in RDF.",
        "owner_org": "3b9d8f87-dbbb-4ae4-9ba4-0dbee0c3baf7",
